# SFL Community API

Before changing farm fetches, identify, join SFL calls, or key pooling, read
the **sunflower-land-community-api** skill:

`.cursor/skills/sunflower-land-community-api/SKILL.md`

Live upstream docs: https://sunflower-land.com/community-docs/#/endpoints

- Throttle is **per IP**, ~1 request / 5s, 10s if you hammer. FarmSync uses
  one key, POST `/community/getFarms` in batches, GET as fallback.
- Never call `api.sunflower-land.com` from the frontend. Never log full keys.
